          "type": "kotak",
          "title": "Min dut and min ematen dit",
          "items": [
            "*Buruko mina dut* — \"I have head pain\", the most common and safest way.",
            "*Buruak min ematen dit* — \"my head gives me pain\", a pattern that uses the three-way auxiliary (NORK-NORI-NOR). It sounds very natural from native speakers, and you'll master it at A2.",
            "At A1, the first form is enough. What matters is that the doctor understands you — and *buruko mina dut* does the job."
          ]
        }
